#. module: eh_account_close_workflow
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/eh_account_close_workflow/static/src/js/tours/close_tour.js:0
msgid ""
"On a run, the <b>tasks tab</b> is your checklist. Each task carries an "
"assignee, due date, and a Done/Skipped/Blocked status. Pending Approval "
"blocks until every required task is complete."
msgstr ""
"Dalam sebuah proses, <b>tab tugas</b> adalah daftar periksa Anda. Setiap "
"tugas memiliki penerima tugas, tanggal jatuh tempo, dan status "
"Selesai/Dilewati/Terhambat. Menunggu Persetujuan terhambat hingga setiap "
"tugas yang diperlukan selesai."

#. module: eh_account_close_workflow
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/eh_account_close_workflow/static/src/js/tours/close_tour.js:0
msgid ""
"Once Closed, the run is locked but the period isn't. Use <b>Reopen</b> to "
"roll back to In Progress when a missed entry needs to land. Reopens are "
"stamped with user + reason in chatter for audit."
msgstr ""
"Setelah Ditutup, proses terkunci tetapi periode tidak. Gunakan <b>Reopen</b>"
" untuk kembali ke Sedang Berlangsung saat entri yang terlewat perlu "
"dimasukkan. Pembukaan ulang dicatat dengan pengguna + alasan di chatter "
"untuk audit."

